      "id": "tfnexbuyer000001-11",
      "name": "Verify hire claim",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-taifoon.taifoon",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One item: the match preview, the hire, the grade, the settlement, and whether the chain agrees.\nconst preview = $('Preview the match').first().json;\nconst r = (preview.resolved || {});\nlet d = null; try { d = $('Get demand').last().json.demand; } catch (e) { d = null; }\nlet hs = null; try { hs = $('Get handshake').last().json; } catch (e) { hs = null; }\nlet job = null; try { job = $('Explorer').last().json.job; } catch (e) { job = null; }\nlet att = null; try { att = $('Verify hire claim').last().json; } catch (e) { att = null; }\nconst tx = d && d.ending ? d.ending.tx || null : null;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  preview: { class: preview.class || r.class || null, input: preview.input || null, how: r.how || null,\n             premium: (preview.cover_preview || {}).premium || null, chain_id: preview.chainId || null },\n  demand: d ? d.id : null, state: d ? d.state : 'preview only', why: d ? d.why || null : null,\n  seller: d ? d.seller || null : null,\n  handshake: hs ? { id: hs.handshake_id, state: hs.state, chosen: ((hs.candidate || {}).choice || {}).chosen || null } : null,\n  grade: d && d.grade ? { verdict: d.grade.verdict || null, checks: d.grade.checks || null } : null,\n  job_id: d ? d.job_id || null : null, chain_id: d ? d.chainId || null : null,\n  settle_tx: tx, settle_link: tx ? `https://www.taifoon.io/scan/${d.chainId}/tx/${tx}` : null,\n  doer: job && job.doer ? job.doer.seller || null : null,\n  payee: job && job.payee ? job.payee.address || null : null,\n  attestation: att ? { verdict: att.verdict || null, checks: att.checks || att.findings || null } : null,\n  explorer: d ? `https://www.taifoon.io/scan/jobs/${d.id}` : null,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "tfnexbuyer000001-12",
      "name": "Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Buyer: say what you need, get it done and verified\n\n1. Attach your **Taifoon Relayer API** credential to the Demand and Handshake nodes.\n2. Edit **Need** (quote exact inputs inside the sentence). `preview_only: true` stops after the preview.\n3. Execute. **Preview the match** is a dry run (class, input, cover preview; nothing kept). **Post demand** posts it; the auto-match loop (every 2 min) picks a seller, opens the handshake, grades by code and settles.\n\nSettlement runs on the **Taifoon devnet 36927** (test tokens, no value). Nothing is signed by this workflow. Polls ≤ 20 × 20 s.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "tfnexbuyer000001-n13",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
